  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Orewa's most sought-after spots on Centreway Road, this beautifully renovated freehold family sanctuary offers the ultimate blend of modern comfort, generous proportions, and easy beachside living. Situated right next to the lush greenery of Western Reserve and approximately 180 metres from the golden sands of Orewa Beach, this much-loved home brings the best of coastal living right to your doorstep.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a light-filled interior designed with family functionality in mind. The stylish and modern open plan kitchen flows seamlessly to the main living and dining area and out to the covered outdoor entertaining. The additional separate living area provides ample space for effortless entertaining or quiet relaxation. \r\n\r\nAccommodation is well catered for with four bedrooms and three stylish bathrooms, including two private ensuites. The upper level is dedicated to a spacious master suite, creating a tranquil sanctuary away from the main living zones. Outdoors, the home sits within fully fenced and gated grounds, boasting a sunny deck designed for summer barbecues and weekend lounging. \r\n\r\nComplete with handy dual access, off-street parking, and a convenient carport, every practical need has been thoughtfully covered. Modern finishes throughout ensure you can simply move in, unpack, and start enjoying the relaxed seaside lifestyle immediately.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and this property simply cannot be beaten. Stroll along the flat paths to Orewa’s vibrant hub of cafés, boutique shops, and popular restaurants. Families will appreciate being in zone for local schools, including Orewa Beach School and Orewa College, while commuters will love the quick, easy access to the  motorway interchange for smooth travel north or south.\r\n\r\nOffering space, location, and effortless coastal charm, this pristine home truly ticks all the boxes and more. Get in quick before you miss out on this prime Orewa opportunity!",
